WEBVTT

00:07:29.737 --> 00:07:31.739
I said, "I didn't know you spoke English."

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:33.491
He said, "I speak perfect English."

00:07:33.491 --> 00:07:35.910
I said, "In that case,
who's your favorite Beatle?"

00:07:35.951 --> 00:07:37.119
He said, "Paul."

00:07:37.119 --> 00:07:38.829
I said, "What's your favorite song?

00:07:38.829 --> 00:07:40.498
Is it 'Back in the USSR?'"

00:07:40.539 --> 00:07:42.791
(Laughter)

00:07:42.791 --> 00:07:44.585
Yeah, he didn't like that very much.

00:07:45.294 --> 00:07:47.004
And then he said, "No.

00:07:48.172 --> 00:07:50.633
My favorite song is ‘Yesterday.’

00:07:50.674 --> 00:07:51.926
Think about it."

00:07:52.801 --> 00:07:54.428
And I thought about it.

00:07:55.012 --> 00:07:58.849
And I realized I'm being sent
a subliminal message

00:07:58.891 --> 00:08:02.853
about the old days of power
and authority of the Soviet Union